[engl]
{100}{}{Bitsbob}
{200}{}{You see Bob, proprietor of Bob's Iguana Bits.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Bob05]}
{2000}{}{Hi! Welcome to Bob's Iguana Bits, the family eating place. Can I take your order?}
{2010}{}{Gimme' an iguana on a stick.}
{2020}{}{Me hungry! Grrrrr!}
{2030}{}{What can you tell me about a Water Chip?}
{2040}{}{What can you tell me about Decker?}
{2050}{}{What can you tell me about Decker?}
{2060}{}{I think we need to talk about Doc Morbid and some of your secret ingredients.}
{2070}{}{Do you know anything about the missing caravans?}
{2080}{}{Anything interesting happening in the Hub?}
{2090}{}{Nothing, bye.}
{2100}{}{Me go now.}
{3000}{}{Hey, I don't want any trouble!}
{3010}{}{What, me trouble? What gives you that impression?}
{4000}{}{Sure. We got whole iguana on a stick for twenty bucks, and our prime select pieces for
eight bucks.}
{4010}{}{I'll take one of the real ones.}
{4020}{}{No sissy portions! Me want all iguana! Ugh!}
{4030}{}{I'll take one of the prime cuts.}
{4040}{}{Hmm, smell good! Me want prime!}
{4050}{}{Nothing for me right now. I'm on a diet.}
{4060}{}{Uhh... Me no hungry now.}
{5000}{}{Sorry, you can't afford it.
---
One whole iguana coming up! Anything else?}
{5010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{6000}{}{Sorry, you can't afford it.
---
You know what they're made from and you still want one? You make Decker look like a
charity worker! Anything else?
---
One iguana prime select choice, coming up! Anything else?}
{6010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{6020}{}{I don't like your attitude.}
{7000}{}{Tough. You want money, I'll give it to you. You want food, I'll give it to you. You want
to die, I'll arrange it. But "like" ain't part of the equation.}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{Smart choice. You could stand to lose a few pounds.}
{8010}{}{[Done.]}
{9000}{}{Never seen any of them around here. Water Merchants don't need 'em.}
{9010}{}{Water Merchants?}
{10000}{}{You must be new in town if you're asking me about the Water Merchants. Water is life,
and you don't get much more powerful than life and death.}
{10010}{}{[Tell me more about.]}
{11000}{}{Well, he's dead now, and my cash flow has increased because of it.}
{11010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{12000}{}{Mr. Decker is a distinguished businessman in a less than distinguished business.
Anything else?}
{12010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{12020}{}{What kind of business?}
{13000}{}{If there's anything that involves misery and suffering in the Hub, Decker either
controls it or wants to control it. Anything else?}
{13010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{14000}{}{What are you talking about?}
{14010}{}{Your secret ingredients. How fresh does the corpse have to be before it develops a
bitter aftertaste? Do you use mutants, humans, or a mix?}
{14020}{}{I found an invoice in Doc Morbid's lair. An invoice for dead bodies...}
{14030}{}{If you've got a memory loss, I can talk to the sheriff.}
{14040}{}{Prime Choice Select is made of people!!!! It's made of people!!!}
{15000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Bob20a']}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob34]}
{15020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob36]}
{16000}{}{I don't know what you're talking about, and I don't appreciate your slander! I suggest
you don't show your face in here again.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{Not so loud! I don't need you saying that all over the Hub...}
{17010}{}{I guess I was rude. Have a nice day...}
{17020}{}{You know, the police station is just across the street. I really should take a little
walk.}
{17030}{}{I can get even louder. But I can also shut up. Noise is cheap, silence is expensive.}
{18000}{}{Uh, bye.}
{18010}{}{[Done.]}
{19000}{}{Wait a minute. We've got to find a way to reach a mutual understanding!}
{19010}{}{The only way you'll be able to keep me quiet is to kill me.}
{19020}{}{Fine. What can I get out of this?}
{19030}{}{Sorry, no deal.}
{20000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BobCombat']}
{20010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> combat]}
{21000}{}{Fine. What do you want me to pay?}
{21010}{}{I want 50 bucks every day.}
{21020}{}{I want 75 bucks every day.}
{21030}{}{I want 100 bucks every day.}
{21040}{}{I don't think I'll blackmail you. Carry on.}
{22000}{}{Fine. Maybe it would be good if our paths didn't cross again.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{I'd change your mind if I were you, friend. People have died for less in the Hub.}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{Don't do that! Fine, I've been using some questionable portions. But it's not like I'm
committing murder. Doc Morbid's stuff is already dead, isn't it?}
{24010}{}{I'm sure it is, Bob. Have a nice day...}
{24020}{}{Cannibalism is a crime against humanity, Bob. I'm going to see that you pay for it.}
{24030}{}{Maybe it is. Maybe it isn't. I don't care. I want a piece of the action.}
{25000}{}{Terrible business. Those poor people. Oh, those poor people. Losing their lives in such
a ghastly way! Is there anything else I can do for you? Like feed you, perhaps?}
{25010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{26000}{}{Someone killed Decker. We're in mourning. [snicker]
---
Someone shot Sheriff Greene. Don't know about the deputy, though.
---
Daren Hightower was murdered. And all that money couldn't save him. Ironic, ain't it?
---
Someone stole a necklace from the Hightowers. Man, did they ever make a big mistake.
They're dead for sure!
---
Someone killed Jain over at the Cathedral. I hear she was a real pain in the butt!
---
Well, the only new thing is that the Children of the Cathedral has taken over the
Hospital. It's pretty boring around here lately.
---
Anything else?}
{26010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{27000}{}{Nothing. Sorry to bring it up. Now is there anything else I can do for you?}
{27010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobStandardQuestions]}
{28000}{}{Ok, Ok, I've got your money.}
{28010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobBlackmailQuestions]}
{29000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BobBlackmailQuestions']}
{29010}{}{What can you tell me about Decker?}
{29020}{}{Nothing, bye.}
{29030}{}{I've got more expenses. I need to increase the payment.}
{29040}{}{Screw this. I want ALL of your money now, or you're a dead Bob.}
{29050}{}{I can't take the heat. I'm calling off the payments.}
{29060}{}{What can you tell me about Decker?}
{29070}{}{I want information on Doc Morbid.}
{30000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BBQa']}
{30010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob09]}
{30020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob13]}
{31000}{}{Fine. What do you want me to pay?}
{31010}{}{[Done.]}
{32000}{}{You can stick it! I ain't ever payin' you! Get lost!}
{32010}{}{[Done.]}
{33000}{}{Forget it.}
{33010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobCombat]}
{34000}{}{You are? Well, Ok...}
{34010}{}{[Done.]}
{35000}{}{He's a mean son of a bitch. You don't want to mess with him. Anything else?}
{35010}{}{Gimme' an iguana on a stick.}
{35020}{}{I want information on Doc Morbid.}
{36000}{}{Doc Morbid? All I know is that he's up around Junktown and he's the cheapest source of
food I could find. That's all!}
{36010}{}{[Done.]}
{37000}{}{I'm sorry. I ain't payin' no more. Do what you want with me.}
{37010}{}{Bob, I thought we were pals! In fact, I was thinking about giving you a promotion in my
organization. Instead, you betray me. This is very disappointing...}
{37020}{}{Bob, why should I take no for an answer? Especially from a scumbag like you?}
{37030}{}{Glad to see you're standing up for yourself.}
{37040}{}{Your reputation is history, Bob. Hi-sto-ree!}
{37050}{}{Fine, I'll decide what to do with you later.}
{37060}{}{Well, it was nice knowing you Bob. Say 'hi' to Satan for me.}
{38000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Bob01a']}
{38010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob13]}
{38020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob13]}
{38030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Bob12]}
{39000}{}{Fine! Take your money and get out!}
{39010}{}{[Done.]}
{40000}{}{Yeah, sure. Why don't you find someone else to screw over.}
{40010}{}{[Done.]}
{41000}{}{You can't throw crap without getting some of it on your fingers. Get out of here!}
{41010}{}{[Done.]}
{42000}{}{Sure you will. Get lost!}
{42010}{}{[Done.]}
{43000}{}{What are you doing back so soon? It ain't time for the payment.}
{43010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BobBlackmailQuestions]}
{44000}{}{You've got a lot of nerve showing your face around here. Get lost!}
{44010}{}{[Done.]}

